  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="4">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Abt">Abt</ref> 4</head>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="ang" source="#liebermann" n="4" corresp="#wit-h">Gif frigman cyninge stele, IXgylde forgylde.</ab>
        <ab type="editionText" xml:lang="ang" source="#oliver" n="10" corresp="#wit-h">Gif frigman cyninge stele, IX gylde forgylde.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#oliver" corresp="#wit-h">If a freeman should steal from the king, let him compensate with 9[-fold] compensation.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#attenborough" corresp="#wit-h">If a freeman robs the king, he shall pay back a nine fold amount.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#whitelock" corresp="#wit-h">If a freeman steal from the king, he is to repay nine-fold.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="de" source="#liebermann">Wenn ein Freier dem Könige [etwas] stiehlt, vergelte er [es ihm] 9fach.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#claude" ana="#fromGerman">If a freeman steals [something] from the king, let him repay [it to him] 9-fold.</ab>
        <note type="comparedBy" source="#liebermann"><ref target="clause:Grith_7">Grið 7</ref></note>
      </div>
    </body>
